                                "example_id": "56045791-1aae-490f-8846-f8b42cf38f62",
                                "sense_id": "7263e6d5-d306-374f-9320-56dcbe144ecc",
                                "text": "It was a goal that showcased all of the 20-year-old’s qualities as he outjumped Nahuel Ferraresi to win the header and shot at Faríñez with his right foot before slotting home the rebound with his left."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36c0dc3f-a4d7-4a5a-bb05-6f44ce1a45ad",
                                "sense_id": "7263e6d5-d306-374f-9320-56dcbe144ecc",
                                "text": "'Well,' Smiley says, easy and careless, 'he's good enough for one thing, I should judge — he can outjump any frog in Calaveras Country.'"
                            }
                        ]
